<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Confirmed:   None  Week Ago:  4,400  Year Ago:  2,300</p>
<p>Wk to Date:  None  Week Ago: 20,700  Year Ago: 15,100</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
